"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [120]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["After what seems like an eternity of travelling "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the tunnels you're finally plopped out, landing "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["with a heavy splash in the black tar below."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [120]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Despite being freed from the tunnels, it's still "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["too dark to make out your surroundings, or the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["silhouettes of your friends."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{K-Kim? Fera?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{I'm-\\....here?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hey don't shout in my ear like that!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{I didn't realise you were "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["so...close? Wait, where are "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{Fera is also here..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Shit, you scared me! Don't sneak up on "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["me like that!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{Did not. Haven't moved."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hold on, I think my eyes are starting to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["adjust, I'll try and get over to...\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{\\n[1]? What is it?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["ScifiNPC2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I think I figured out why you two sound "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["so close..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Latex96", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I think we're going to be very close "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["from now on..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["We're fused together?! And we're some "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["sort of black slime girl thing?!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Seems like it Kim...\\.that's you right?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yeah I'm-\\.\\^"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No, I'm Kim."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What?\\. But why do I...wait, am I Fera?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["This is so annoying..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\n[1], what are we going to do? "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["We have to find a way out of here!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I agree, but it looks like-\\.\\^"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["-the only way out is above us."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What the...\\.why am I over here now?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You're not, you've always been there."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You just interrupted me."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No I was definitely where you were.\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Wait, which one are you?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm \\n[1]."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I thought you were Kim."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No I'm Kim!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But that can't be \\n[1], "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["because I'm \\n[1]!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Then where's Fera?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm here."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But you just said you were Kim."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["This is too confusing."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Whatever, I'm going to go have a look "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["for a way out."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm going to look over there."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ow! Stop it, that hurts! You're both "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["pulling me apart!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well that doesn't work..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I have an idea, but you're not going "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to like it."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You want us to try and merge together, "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["right?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yeah, how did you know?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I just...did. We're connected after all. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And you're right, I hate it."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I will try it. I don't mind."]}, {"indent": 0, "c