 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["It's like every part of me is having an "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["orgasm!\\. I think I'm going to-\\.\\^"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 250, "parameters": [{"name": "Water1", "pitch": 80, "volume": 90}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Slime92", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hello? Did it work?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I think so, we're like a puddle now. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I can feel the rest of this stuff too, "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["not just us."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Haha, I'm so big! I'm the entire room!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Come on, we can't be a puddle! We need "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["reform, we need a body! Focus!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 250, "parameters": [{"name": "Water2", "pitch": 80, "volume": 90}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Slime87", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Gah, this is wrong! Too many eyes! "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Alright, everyone take a body part. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No overlapping!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 250, "parameters": [{"name": "Water2", "pitch": 80, "volume": 90}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "BlueSlime82", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "p